  "description": "Dependency-free file type detection for .NET: magic bytes for about 70 formats (Office and OpenDocument inside ZIP, HEIC/AVIF/MP4 brands, WebP, JPEG XL), extension and MIME mapping, content vs. extension checks and safe upload checks (executables, scripts, double extensions, SVG with script). Register your own file types and upload rules. Native AOT compatible.",
