  "releaseNotes": "Macro-enabled Office detection (Docm, Xlsm, Pptm, HasMacros) with UploadPolicy.AllowMacros; ZIP central directory reading from seekable streams, so large DOCX/XLSX/PPTX files are recognized. The docm/xlsm/pptm extensions now map to the macro-enabled types.",
